<p>Jeyaseelan (Canada)/Tom Kempers (Netherlands) 3-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Kathy Rinaldi-Stunkel/Trevor Kronemann (U.S.) beat Noelle Van</p>
<p>Lottum (France)/Gary Muller (South Africa) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Louise Pleming (Australia)/Neil Broad (Britain) beat Annabel</p>
<p>Ellwood/Andrew Florent (Australia) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Kristine Kunce (Australia)/Scott Davis (U.S.) beat Amelie</p>
<p>Mauresmo/Sebastien Grosjean (France) 6-7 (5-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner/Karsten Braasch (Germany) beat Mariaan De</p>
<p>Swardt/Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-2 6-4</p>
