<p>(Britain)/Piet Norval (South Africa) 7-6 (7-5) 2-6 10-8</p>
<p>Karsten Braasch/Jens Knippschild (Germany) beat 6-Ellis</p>
<p>Ferreira (South Africa)/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) 6-4 3-6 10-8</p>
<p>Luke Jensen/Murphy Jensen (U.S.) beat Emanuel Couto/Bernardo</p>
<p>Mota (Portugal) 4-6 6-4 11-9</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell/Francisco Roig (Spain) beat 3-Mark Knowles</p>
